        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ile watu wa Misri wataogopa kama wanawake. Watatetemeka kwa hofu watakapomwona Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi ameunyosha mkono wake dhidi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda atakuwa tishio kubwa kwa Wamisri. Wote watakaoambiwa habari za Yuda wataingiwa na woga kwa sababu ya jambo aliloamua Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi kuwatenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo lugha ya Kiebrania itatumika katika miji mitano ya Misri, na watu wa miji hiyo wataapa kuwa waaminifu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi. Mji mmojawapo utaitwa “Mji wa Jua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mji wa Jua:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au Heliopoli, mji ulioko katika delta ya mto Nili; tafsiri nyingine: Mji wa Uharibifu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, kutakuwa na madhabahu kwa ajili ya Mwenyezi-Mungu katikati ya nchi ya Misri, na nguzo iliyowekwa wakfu kwa Mungu kwenye mpaka wa Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madhabahu hiyo itakuwa ishara na ushuhuda kwake Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi katika nchi ya Misri. Watu wakimlilia Mwenyezi-Mungu humo kwa sababu ya kukandamizwa, yeye atawapelekea mkombozi atakayewatetea na kuwakomboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu atajijulisha kwa Wamisri na hapo ndipo Wamisri watakapomkiri na kumwabudu kwa kumtolea tambiko na sadaka za kuteketezwa. Hali kadhalika, watamwekea Mwenyezi-Mungu nadhiri ambazo watazitimiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu atawaadhibu Wamisri na kuwaponya. Nao watamrudia, naye atayasikiliza maombi yao na kuwaponya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, kutakuwa na barabara kuu kutoka nchi ya Misri hadi nchi ya Ashuru. Waashuru watawatembelea Wamisri, na Wamisri watawatembelea Waashuru; nao wote watamwabudu Mungu pamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, Israeli itahesabiwa pamoja na Misri na Ashuru; mataifa haya matatu yatakuwa baraka kwa dunia yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi atawabariki na kusema, “Wabarikiwe Wamisri watu wangu, kadhalika na Waashuru ambao ni ishara ya kazi yangu na Waisraeli walio mali yangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
